            "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sweden_%26_Norway._(to_accompany)_A_New_Universal_Atlas_Containing_Maps_of_the_various_Empires,_Kingdoms_(IA_dr_sweden-norway-to-accompany-a-new-universal-atlas-containing-maps-of-th-3697056).jpg",
